// Pre-scripted "Tour Mode" experiences for Travel Earth.
//
// Each tour is a sequence of steps. A step has:
//   - an audio clip (already pre-generated by scripts/generate-demo-audio.mjs)
//   - a camera target (lat/lng/height/pitch)
//   - a caption text
//   - optional marker + cart items to add when the step starts
//
// The tour controller in TravelEarth.jsx fires camera flyTo + audio play
// simultaneously at the start of each step, then advances when audio ends
// (plus a small breath). Cart and marker mutations happen on step start so
// the user sees items appear in real time as the story unfolds.

